                'PicklistService: both the object and field API names are required.'
            );
        }

        final String objectKey = objectApiName.trim().toLowerCase();
        final String fieldKey = fieldApiName.trim().toLowerCase();

        // Resolve the SObject (case-insensitive; standard or custom).
        Schema.DescribeSObjectResult sobjectDesc = null;
        for (Schema.DescribeSObjectResult obj : Schema.getGlobalDescribe().values()) {
            if (obj.getName().toLowerCase() == objectKey) {
